A||||5||mrfixit58||2.8 to 3.4 Short Block Conversion||||5||
Z||000000||mrfixit58||03-28-2000||04:56 PM||||OK guys,<P>I have a line on a rebuildable 3.4 core for CHEAP.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  I'm trying to do a little research and hope you can help. Now for the questions...<P>- Do the 3.1 and the 3.4 use the same crank?<P>- What about the head gaskets? do I have to buy both a complete set for a 2.8 Fiero AND head gaskets for the 3.4?<P>- I book marked Ed Parks page where he discribes the conversion, do anyone know of any other sites I could visit for a different prospective?<P>Thanks for your help,<BR>Roy <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif"> and somewhat dazed...||||reg||5
Z||000001||1FST2M6||03-28-2000||05:00 PM||||Wish i could help ya .. I've spoken with Chris West a few times and He seem to have a clue with this conversion and carrys a wide range of go fast goodies for his motor and stuff for it and the Fiero.... <A HREF="http://home.earthlink.net/~chriswest/Exhaust/Exhaust.html" TARGET=_blank>http://home.earthlink.net/~chriswest/Exhaust/Exhaust.html</A>     sorry you'll have to back up to home but this gets ya close. ||||reg||1
Z||000002||Alex4mula||03-28-2000||05:32 PM||||Head gasket should be the same. The 2.8, 3.1 & 3.4 can use the same 2.8 Fiero heads. The 3.4 crank is different from the 2.8. I'm not sure about the 3.1 but here is my guess it should be different. You should call Ed. I don't know if you met him at the Daytona show. ||||reg||1
Z||000003||Dan87GT||03-28-2000||05:58 PM||||Heads are the same, the 3.1 and 3.4 use the same crank(bore is bigger)||||reg||1
Z||000004||batboy||03-28-2000||06:15 PM||||I believe the head gasket is different and you must use the 3.4 head gasket because it's a bigger bore than the 2.8 or 3.1 engines. Dan is correct, the 3.1 and 3.4 crank is the same. I'd buy a gasket set for the 3.4, not sure why you'd need any 2.8 gaskets. Chris West knows about 3.4 TDC conversions, but Ed Parks is the expert on 3.4 pushrod, single cam engine swaps.||||reg||1
